{
  "c0s1-0": {
    "line": "c0s1-0",
    "text": "同一个小广场，只改光照参数，就能得到完全不同的氛围。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "2504f9f71bd160d8d94176cb2c3e0bc5347b6b1f4acc86b6bb11f309c02e36b3",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s1-0-2504f9f71bd1",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s1-0-2504f9f71bd1/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 24.62,
    "raw_sha256": "0205f635970ae70576f10831c1a9e4f214045bfac68280825a453f712795dd53",
    "raw_seconds": 5.48
  },
  "c0s3-0": {
    "line": "c0s3-0",
    "text": "这套实验室分成五个模块，由浅入深：",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "3c7ba09956179f89c9c0f88ec57e3012f7aa8182de971f9aa8adf46189bd5b81",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s3-0-3c7ba0995617",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s3-0-3c7ba0995617/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.16,
    "raw_sha256": "4a0833cfd3c5f0d71a12debcae2d916a2d5d3869529c2c06d410acc67243ab1f",
    "raw_seconds": 3.84
  },
  "c0s3-1": {
    "line": "c0s3-1",
    "text": "法线、光照模型、光源与阴影、全局光照与后处理，最后是氛围配方。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "95698a9c2ebc36164dda352ac60efea51fb2b8a0890b11bfcdf73e056629add6",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s3-1-95698a9c2ebc",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s3-1-95698a9c2ebc/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.18,
    "raw_sha256": "299ffa4a98d3cb9095614c377d5d904862f95618f6db105a6efe57f412759bd3",
    "raw_seconds": 7.12
  },
  "c0s4-0": {
    "line": "c0s4-0",
    "text": "每个模块都有参考场景、可调参数、预设和调试视图。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "6b115882ad76c1fb8c0a732927cc3d61eacf79c8033d35ed0abd6c2073faa00c",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s4-0-6b115882ad76",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s4-0-6b115882ad76/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.14,
    "raw_sha256": "9c989f4e0f033ddcfb940247f0600768c0c5585c68a1e4e35e908a6b3e02fdb5",
    "raw_seconds": 5.44
  },
  "c0s4-1": {
    "line": "c0s4-1",
    "text": "左边点预设，右边拖参数，底部是中文说明。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "cd3e98a0c9176fe5200479d0e9c45b1970b37c9c3cbab548dbb0fed1811b57c6",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s4-1-cd3e98a0c917",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c0s4-1-cd3e98a0c917/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.2,
    "raw_sha256": "631399b9785c0f10e641353e2629e56ba234368795cf5fb1fbf4163622cc43f4",
    "raw_seconds": 4.52
  },
  "c1s1-0": {
    "line": "c1s1-0",
    "text": "光照计算的第一步，是知道表面朝向哪里，这个方向叫法线。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "cc3832b3f6ff4d4e0502d9bd7a1abadfbe0d51fbaecf087376b2a0dfd5dbfa05",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s1-0-cc3832b3f6ff",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s1-0-cc3832b3f6ff/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.28,
    "raw_sha256": "c4cb6050db0a6f488316a41452f93d2177854563131950775496a42f59e8b395",
    "raw_seconds": 5.72
  },
  "c1s1-1": {
    "line": "c1s1-1",
    "text": "画面把法线画成了颜色：朝上偏绿，朝右偏红，朝向镜头偏蓝。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "cc19e3dc6728ecd178f2ac161b73bfd81a34514a1a012aeaf5614788f5215979",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s1-1-cc19e3dc6728",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s1-1-cc19e3dc6728/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.07,
    "raw_sha256": "542bb42393bcc95d32dcf88b7b05e956c337747a784a6716edf1fcf1e14b7232",
    "raw_seconds": 6.88
  },
  "c1s1-2": {
    "line": "c1s1-2",
    "text": "漫反射的亮度，基本取决于法线与光线方向的点积，N 点乘 L。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "53ca96345f6f8da699ac49d1e3ec77fecaf0f503d006899d1544b22069e1d414",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s1-2-53ca96345f6f",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s1-2-53ca96345f6f/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.22,
    "raw_sha256": "c7eaa0d50deeb06a752c885456639977dfe0124d2aef4a703a773ce0b083ce4e",
    "raw_seconds": 5.96
  },
  "c1s2-0": {
    "line": "c1s2-0",
    "text": "法线存在顶点上，面内的法线由三个顶点插值得到。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "b41c7fed645973a50939c211e11ca071ca7c59442b900a150c428bd44bb18559",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s2-0-b41c7fed6459",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s2-0-b41c7fed6459/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.07,
    "raw_sha256": "9977e1a883a2413a395994afb8c25270139c4dee5f8582dc5f91b2ca3208e7e8",
    "raw_seconds": 5.0
  },
  "c1s2-1": {
    "line": "c1s2-1",
    "text": "低模球改用面法线，就成了一块块的平直着色。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "62cc83f8806053db7735e61fd6ce9ab7e58cc25d84b9a4eb2a06d6b867d97e55",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s2-1-62cc83f88060",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s2-1-62cc83f88060/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 16.97,
    "raw_sha256": "312c6a6ebb285b9f395a17b8df7308779173207e9923fd12aabe6bdd98f0df05",
    "raw_seconds": 4.56
  },
  "c1s2-2": {
    "line": "c1s2-2",
    "text": "反过来，立方体被强行平均法线，侧面会出现错误的渐变。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "28b9ba4e5909910119c7c55071ed21256d4f459010be16a14456aa79fc7125ac",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s2-2-28b9ba4e5909",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s2-2-28b9ba4e5909/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 16.98,
    "raw_sha256": "9de27f9fa61c3a4ca8e6f05a1f1ef6c01c8d57082e1b0c4e74213eb25a1b3bb5",
    "raw_seconds": 5.36
  },
  "c1s3-0": {
    "line": "c1s3-0",
    "text": "法线贴图要在表面上再扭转法线，需要一个局部坐标系，叫切线空间。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "6d6007d34fa16c07cb17579ce4056bd515a50c638db7596ab5857be86197ca37",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s3-0-6d6007d34fa1",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s3-0-6d6007d34fa1/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.25,
    "raw_sha256": "374b39778fa26a92ddd1ca6f62e7472a38433dfeca06ea3c5ffabd516fbce655",
    "raw_seconds": 7.24
  },
  "c1s3-1": {
    "line": "c1s3-1",
    "text": "红色是切线 T，绿色是副切线 B，蓝色是法线 N。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "7dd2c66aa1e14fc8bd51b5a6474c82b7db4810e15ed40a715330a2454202fe8a",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s3-1-7dd2c66aa1e1",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s3-1-7dd2c66aa1e1/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.51,
    "raw_sha256": "aa7bc804bf49ce8cd4eba2a34050e9170d2184e894e960081f68fd37825409d0",
    "raw_seconds": 5.36
  },
  "c1s4-0": {
    "line": "c1s4-0",
    "text": "法线贴图把这个空间里的方向存成颜色，淡紫色代表不扰动。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "49a85271abcc5eb34f37257ad937ce341021ce37b2320b0cbd0f693fc84d8c8a",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s4-0-49a85271abcc",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s4-0-49a85271abcc/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.84,
    "raw_sha256": "f5bf279531ff3bad0162f67d4fb8a2142150d8adbfa509999086542311a71300",
    "raw_seconds": 5.96
  },
  "c1s4-1": {
    "line": "c1s4-1",
    "text": "切回正常光照，把光压低到几乎贴着墙面，凹凸感最强。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "171a6535ebab9330deeea453a715bb0e37fff9f9cda095148f9a2f068316a139",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s4-1-171a6535ebab",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s4-1-171a6535ebab/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.41,
    "raw_sha256": "131d5fca2edb783a361d3a313463b9d8869c001f85d7ccde166c03d6e1e78521",
    "raw_seconds": 5.92
  },
  "c1s4-2": {
    "line": "c1s4-2",
    "text": "normal strength 越大，凹凸越深。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "5adcac0a8d5e480ce90809d120d09e2a7a13f6ca1d15bda348cd88a565a5e14b",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s4-2-5adcac0a8d5e",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s4-2-5adcac0a8d5e/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.33,
    "raw_sha256": "a2bbfbf9e9a7d28f36347095d36069eaaee8fe01d90fe05155318ad951d9f11e",
    "raw_seconds": 3.4
  },
  "c1s5-0": {
    "line": "c1s5-0",
    "text": "常见故障一：Godot 使用 Open G L 约定，绿色朝上。",
    "seed": 20261103,
    "cache_key": "3bbbfaf9c05381e6d29ca6e75bd5f30ebdab9c133960b339b204b3694ebc7d90",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s5-0-3bbbfaf9c053",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s5-0-3bbbfaf9c053/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.62,
    "raw_sha256": "de5c3dc9636bac5517c6ec427d52d5acd5cbbc5eeca6486bd4e29f434dfcc350",
    "raw_seconds": 6.04
  },
  "c1s5-1": {
    "line": "c1s5-1",
    "text": "DirectX 格式的贴图绿通道相反，凸起的铆钉看起来像凹坑。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "91fe55c27a8cc696551b2f082a80b129c46c92fca93c2e2a6d0202ee5374981b",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s5-1-91fe55c27a8c",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s5-1-91fe55c27a8c/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.16,
    "raw_sha256": "94dca75650d3aace7a3dda9f89b32ee3f5d74f306dc665c3f04ced33ea8c498d",
    "raw_seconds": 6.08
  },
  "c1s6-0": {
    "line": "c1s6-0",
    "text": "故障二：法线贴图被当成颜色做了 S R G B 转换，表面整体偏暗、偏向一侧。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "b96165b0c1aa92b207dba6e9a085ad56720fc456f97021de2d41a82672a5ad95",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s6-0-b96165b0c1aa",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s6-0-b96165b0c1aa/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.27,
    "raw_sha256": "392cf8443b24ac7731a8c9a52572abc7870682f140d2975986bd83df7cf7f1d0",
    "raw_seconds": 8.84
  },
  "c1s7-0": {
    "line": "c1s7-0",
    "text": "故障三：网格缺少切线，扰动方向就全乱了。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "0b53314189ed8dae874436a8d0f51a38b9d361769b8e7b64bfc32ab669b6f285",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s7-0-0b53314189ed",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s7-0-0b53314189ed/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.35,
    "raw_sha256": "3e26dd636cad0138bab07342f2e9f6755be40db9c9b2dd46867095e7368fee9a",
    "raw_seconds": 4.88
  },
  "c1s7-1": {
    "line": "c1s7-1",
    "text": "导入模型时，记得生成 Mikk T Space 切线。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "d274c9f2a7fceb9447035f2b1c6731476b7a23102a0c29e2e0d10bdb510d697b",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s7-1-d274c9f2a7fc",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c1s7-1-d274c9f2a7fc/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 24.11,
    "raw_sha256": "8aa304d43f2b7842699d8ac2b7334661ff3fe58c4fde6d4e7fdacc4ad61a08fa",
    "raw_seconds": 4.6
  },
  "c2s1-0": {
    "line": "c2s1-0",
    "text": "这一排球从左到右是 Lambert，Half Lambert，Phong，Blinn Phong，和卡通着色，",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "87ae8831efa57367b3e154865f7a10db8b527cb0d5000f6c7d0341a6550ef466",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s1-0-87ae8831efa5",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s1-0-87ae8831efa5/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 22.46,
    "raw_sha256": "02d4bf6f37c6f1cefeae94e8541c3081cc59fca5e68f9ceb5dfe73d3bdfd7c4c",
    "raw_seconds": 6.96
  },
  "c2s1-1": {
    "line": "c2s1-1",
    "text": "最右边是 Godot 内置的 P B R，作为参照。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "d91cee0be7a8fdf671ef5d9a24ed681920ac6749b1dd93d5d6dca988f08e3444",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s1-1-d91cee0be7a8",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s1-1-d91cee0be7a8/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.68,
    "raw_sha256": "6ff50b75d4cdac82275095ec5b4fc558d83c185befd2ea1f4eade8c0f9a357a6",
    "raw_seconds": 3.96
  },
  "c2s2-0": {
    "line": "c2s2-0",
    "text": "先只看 N 点乘 L：正对光源为一，侧面逐渐变暗，背面被截成零。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "939280ea06bd8f378483925bc8789e87b9f42a43167f0ccdebf694f226c70a4d",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s2-0-939280ea06bd",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s2-0-939280ea06bd/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.22,
    "raw_sha256": "fdbb746ecafe0d13729d79cae37a8019b1d5519e734eee7fad45779c14603c3a",
    "raw_seconds": 7.16
  },
  "c2s2-1": {
    "line": "c2s2-1",
    "text": "Half Lambert 把它重新映射到零到一，背光面也保留了层次。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "48505f0e74600a5830717f5c0e883243ee4481d809367cb95f9bfe306876e1ec",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s2-1-48505f0e7460",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s2-1-48505f0e7460/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.1,
    "raw_sha256": "35321996a051b12b41a3904c0b03312a84cb28e441d6963b857cc9e0ca37ab0d",
    "raw_seconds": 5.36
  },
  "c2s3-0": {
    "line": "c2s3-0",
    "text": "高光才是这些模型真正的区别。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "be2248ec6537554c36977675b09da8f24fd53bf15b5b3a8821a8cd6c25d30985",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s3-0-be2248ec6537",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s3-0-be2248ec6537/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.04,
    "raw_sha256": "4f84386ef6e535e9adbfcfc4d44bd8a0f1f4e012aeab7b16a25bf5cdcf30f97c",
    "raw_seconds": 3.0
  },
  "c2s3-1": {
    "line": "c2s3-1",
    "text": "Phong 比较反射向量 R 与视线 V，Blinn Phong 比较法线 N 与半程向量 H。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "999a33302f80646059018e4b3671a4a35a7f8a4777dd5cfa9ffdf5adb347574f",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s3-1-999a33302f80",
