  },
  "c2s3-2": {
    "line": "c2s3-2",
    "text": "同样的指数下，Blinn Phong 的高光更大、更圆。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "0895605edec6f1d47d98a4f05f5f4397f4690a38671e7759ba805c99598f7b40",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s3-2-0895605edec6",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s3-2-0895605edec6/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.1,
    "raw_sha256": "6b706ecedf1e028d671676b1315bdd574f0e83405e53f0f749900b8745545b34",
    "raw_seconds": 4.36
  },
  "c2s4-0": {
    "line": "c2s4-0",
    "text": "看这五根箭头：N 蓝色，L 黄色，V 白色，H 品红，R 青色。",
    "seed": 20261103,
    "cache_key": "260cc3247d92a959e838de510fcf46b161fbbfea918157e428a4be8029215758",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s4-0-260cc3247d92",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s4-0-260cc3247d92/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 18.45,
    "raw_sha256": "72bdcf59a78173498a9cbf5af8c3767a6dc9c7931e21ad551adeaeccd3b42fe8",
    "raw_seconds": 7.64
  },
  "c2s4-1": {
    "line": "c2s4-1",
    "text": "H 位于 L 和 V 正中间，当 N 与 H 重合时，高光最亮。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "81ad98ac72b4978b685c2a58ceffb82874571b3e109b997b6a08969f22641254",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s4-1-81ad98ac72b4",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s4-1-81ad98ac72b4/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.07,
    "raw_sha256": "a90f399ac3a89b8d042adf72f8bdab24fb0a0b56767db7c7b10d9155765de82b",
    "raw_seconds": 6.68
  },
  "c2s5-0": {
    "line": "c2s5-0",
    "text": "高光指数越大，高光越小越锐利，表面显得越光滑。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "e39e5e5e705a9d1bf6f8d08e49efa96e17d9065156d8755be08b81252929fc0f",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s5-0-e39e5e5e705a",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s5-0-e39e5e5e705a/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.03,
    "raw_sha256": "8601b2cf62e94c6032d1814681aba555cd22d9e75c4a4438cb7aab081c337505",
    "raw_seconds": 5.84
  },
  "c2s5-1": {
    "line": "c2s5-1",
    "text": "再打开能量守恒，越集中的高光峰值越亮，这更接近真实。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "239f68b03bbb1058479af818fc4d035029bd82d8136a456c88d000a3ebc938d8",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s5-1-239f68b03bbb",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s5-1-239f68b03bbb/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.06,
    "raw_sha256": "f35c02163a2c542ced9cf6b2f4c0f1598feb8bd549ed50754a302836ed405bb6",
    "raw_seconds": 5.52
  },
  "c2s6-0": {
    "line": "c2s6-0",
    "text": "把 N 点乘 L 量化成两个色阶，高光用阈值硬切，",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "91c7d01680081a29c8629655a9b8fddd2aad0df023dedbf6051103bb58acdf33",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s6-0-91c7d0168008",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s6-0-91c7d0168008/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 16.99,
    "raw_sha256": "93199c2a84ecc1e298c275e8f45bfac11de7fb8a168be88e94dc3c620f6d0a56",
    "raw_seconds": 5.32
  },
  "c2s6-1": {
    "line": "c2s6-1",
    "text": "再加一圈边缘光，就是最基础的卡通渲染。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "e4f240ceafb7d88aecb16d66d967001e1db18ce45e84d80718fe90a491f7cc7d",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s6-1-e4f240ceafb7",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s6-1-e4f240ceafb7/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 16.96,
    "raw_sha256": "edf24757759154b78a7affaca69a2a8ef520d0a10e64461d9762187ef0036b7e",
    "raw_seconds": 4.16
  },
  "c2s7-0": {
    "line": "c2s7-0",
    "text": "P B R 只用粗糙度和金属度两个参数来描述材质。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "060df854aca62f88c8819c6b6238dd4c89c9b62777d5e439af370c408b85f6cc",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s7-0-060df854aca6",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s7-0-060df854aca6/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.02,
    "raw_sha256": "5a7f2440ca32190c78f6946b4c137398d78f04e3a31b2a21e27a3d6c84be3e4e",
    "raw_seconds": 4.88
  },
  "c2s7-1": {
    "line": "c2s7-1",
    "text": "横向是粗糙度从零到一，纵向是金属度从下到上。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "e84cc769f23fd62efece5925913e0781ea9178ae188d251c065eadae930ff71f",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s7-1-e84cc769f23f",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s7-1-e84cc769f23f/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 20.52,
    "raw_sha256": "b9f83b51c86f79ea2d6a0c6dc367ae1dda04a54046c0493be53e9062b31229d8",
    "raw_seconds": 5.08
  },
  "c2s7-2": {
    "line": "c2s7-2",
    "text": "金属没有漫反射，颜色全部来自反射；越粗糙，高光越宽越暗。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "496496281fbed937579fc9abb6fe6817a1d4d09076e1b7ea510472ee1c184475",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s7-2-496496281fbe",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c2s7-2-496496281fbe/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.28,
    "raw_sha256": "e0a96062104b965897e27bd34bbd4ca364fe75c7eec3ecb4f9023144349b79bb",
    "raw_seconds": 6.52
  },
  "c3s1-0": {
    "line": "c3s1-0",
    "text": "平行光模拟太阳：只有方向没有位置，所有阴影朝向一致。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "8d01bcbec980476b2c167dfb4cf514336e1320b6af1010214a3e900da9e832ff",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s1-0-8d01bcbec980",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s1-0-8d01bcbec980/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.12,
    "raw_sha256": "533918e39ac312e8cfe7951d8b3b5432dd847fd4197671f5d280ca5afae74c2a",
    "raw_seconds": 5.76
  },
  "c3s2-0": {
    "line": "c3s2-0",
    "text": "点光从一个点向四周发光，亮度随距离衰减。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "f5df726cd6468dc30e03ffdb8f795cece2fea4863c2890125269fadc35bceca4",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s2-0-f5df726cd646",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s2-0-f5df726cd646/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.15,
    "raw_sha256": "54241bf8f953c3a70c291bc3d25d30c88d2a4f94ba0dee30422335cc4d89953d",
    "raw_seconds": 4.68
  },
  "c3s3-0": {
    "line": "c3s3-0",
    "text": "聚光是一个光锥，还能用投影纹理投出窗框的图案。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "8625bcd2a0ead64e328040699d37261b9f28d216fca3fe1fa9d9e5cd7034ae5d",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s3-0-8625bcd2a0ea",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s3-0-8625bcd2a0ea/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.18,
    "raw_sha256": "b39b0e698d20de6ff58f03ef2710aaf1a089fa070bad9acf60aea7b37b01f078",
    "raw_seconds": 5.0
  },
  "c3s4-0": {
    "line": "c3s4-0",
    "text": "Godot 四点七新增了面光源：光从一整块矩形发出，阴影边缘更柔和。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "6efca6ad32d78e3256c13bcdc0143e275f0d49155a6d028f89d077a52a76d9f6",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s4-0-6efca6ad32d7",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s4-0-6efca6ad32d7/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.65,
    "raw_sha256": "939215ecf007821a1f4c0ae9d9f88d0989084c9b66c7b0fbb9f9cac757736317",
    "raw_seconds": 7.68
  },
  "c3s5-0": {
    "line": "c3s5-0",
    "text": "实时阴影靠阴影贴图：先从光源方向渲染一张深度图，",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "3689164dfb1e62e29254fb8e78c0c0e67df28f409ddb24147db1490b34a2dabd",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s5-0-3689164dfb1e",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s5-0-3689164dfb1e/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.07,
    "raw_sha256": "49f55f809585ffe4fa7445d061259eff5b5ebc29b727202ce452b4302a076c6d",
    "raw_seconds": 5.96
  },
  "c3s5-1": {
    "line": "c3s5-1",
    "text": "着色时比较像素到光源的距离，更远的就在阴影里。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "fe93e69818af8ace625141013a986bfde03aa36c1bd2867062cab14b7ed974ef",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s5-1-fe93e69818af",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s5-1-fe93e69818af/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.21,
    "raw_sha256": "86218be522112e3f6e4bbf4f00f711e541612741d232339ba4872d1a7bbd1c83",
    "raw_seconds": 4.88
  },
  "c3s6-0": {
    "line": "c3s6-0",
    "text": "深度比较有精度误差。把偏移 bias 设为零，",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "581caec7f03a4f1ce3c0feaee4969c5ea7591ec795365f7f50cb57f30dba5297",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s6-0-581caec7f03a",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s6-0-581caec7f03a/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.11,
    "raw_sha256": "8ee2fc6c531da9ce4be7bcec6904af4dec8cb0a8ea24bcd59929be194ae9b5b3",
    "raw_seconds": 4.88
  },
  "c3s6-1": {
    "line": "c3s6-1",
    "text": "表面会和自己的阴影打架，出现条纹，这叫阴影痤疮。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "7c4b1c642022a27ce438c7204255b1d336f52908df1e1257ae9cddf0c727f07c",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s6-1-7c4b1c642022",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s6-1-7c4b1c642022/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.23,
    "raw_sha256": "dc1c0ac2c0fc08419e5530a7a92643b59529f97b84aad72799bf60232c199893",
    "raw_seconds": 5.44
  },
  "c3s6-2": {
    "line": "c3s6-2",
    "text": "慢慢加大 normal bias，条纹就消失了。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "7ab6f070b4e55ac5d86bead877f547bf40bc1b37388bb9d740a018c94e3a5ac3",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s6-2-7ab6f070b4e5",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s6-2-7ab6f070b4e5/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.13,
    "raw_sha256": "7294e4d4dbc8fd66e059dd12e031ad2b27153c6dcca01f8c059592109c015a45",
    "raw_seconds": 3.4
  },
  "c3s7-0": {
    "line": "c3s7-0",
    "text": "但偏移过大，阴影会和物体脱开，像浮在地面上，这叫 Peter Panning。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "f7abec83fed548d8ef1c142aa6b30c91d30d611f7942080018d464c27fec87db",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s7-0-f7abec83fed5",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s7-0-f7abec83fed5/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.25,
    "raw_sha256": "b8aa6f65fa79d889738daf541ff13f8482b194d5d8c8eacdc59fa7a57af8cbef",
    "raw_seconds": 6.68
  },
  "c3s7-1": {
    "line": "c3s7-1",
    "text": "所以偏移够用就好：先调 normal bias，再微调 bias。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "656c77485445320b36b5c7cea178efa7343938f5fc7e0a72e7a37d3307623cb5",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s7-1-656c77485445",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s7-1-656c77485445/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.14,
    "raw_sha256": "01e192a9b224d19cb4e40d07ab24b0df71349f2cfb19f80a2ef24e26c609160c",
    "raw_seconds": 5.36
  },
  "c3s8-0": {
    "line": "c3s8-0",
    "text": "平行光要覆盖很远的范围，所以把视锥切成几段，每段一张阴影图。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "81fb4ff8572a5b2e8aa214fd2406e9d7960cb91c1923c24cdbf54dd7094d3d40",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s8-0-81fb4ff8572a",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s8-0-81fb4ff8572a/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.13,
    "raw_sha256": "a4963b7314b33680aa76d0006bf095361e2fe7f9c0f9e5492ff915e0baad2d29",
    "raw_seconds": 6.68
  },
  "c3s8-1": {
    "line": "c3s8-1",
    "text": "这就是级联阴影 P S S M：近处精度高，远处精度低。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "98c86e97e0c38791a0550085c2245d919d4c83b9f9b1e8aeeafcaf9b27e060a7",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s8-1-98c86e97e0c3",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s8-1-98c86e97e0c3/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.05,
    "raw_sha256": "877f51895b52c62c548aa86e04f6bbea9913105b580ca10c64f558ae97d880b3",
    "raw_seconds": 6.12
  },
  "c3s9-0": {
    "line": "c3s9-0",
    "text": "最后是软阴影。给光源一个角直径，离遮挡物越远，阴影越模糊。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "e6cbe97f4aa5c3d9881b5dccb94dca712bed645ce5d6cb8e2a3ad6db1b2942e1",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s9-0-e6cbe97f4aa5",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s9-0-e6cbe97f4aa5/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.09,
    "raw_sha256": "cda167cfcd663945e7543bc71f33e779480eca562c41cf18baf393e36b0f2472",
    "raw_seconds": 6.64
  },
  "c3s9-1": {
    "line": "c3s9-1",
    "text": "这叫接触硬化，是 P C S S 软阴影的特点。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "eb3bdd730a8d3c2f59776ffdcf38edbc71d986d56611c1dd51e7969bde6c63ae",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s9-1-eb3bdd730a8d",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c3s9-1-eb3bdd730a8d/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.05,
    "raw_sha256": "40611bd3df450403fac5a39cd7721e83b8a6e44096e61ab55a503105f1ed0622",
    "raw_seconds": 4.36
  },
  "c4s1-0": {
    "line": "c4s1-0",
    "text": "关掉环境光和全局光照，只有阳光直接照到的地方是亮的。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "f798e905f753e86568d45243e659de659f8d16d0a18e660778073844a6acc66a",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s1-0-f798e905f753",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s1-0-f798e905f753/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.22,
    "raw_sha256": "d26f4f048a3e2897a8b973f49005a2ab9ff0adaee7054e1a8f2a94d8bbd19980",
    "raw_seconds": 6.0
  },
  "c4s1-1": {
    "line": "c4s1-1",
    "text": "现实中，光会在墙面之间反复反弹，这就是全局光照 G I。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "e2daa033d30d83947e9ff4380af07348d7eb8985d1c3edec715423a87b48b6b4",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s1-1-e2daa033d30d",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s1-1-e2daa033d30d/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.32,
    "raw_sha256": "145e5484108b32faa7eafb130caa60dea011ecd77722af8311294058795c145d",
    "raw_seconds": 6.12
  },
  "c4s2-0": {
    "line": "c4s2-0",
    "text": "打开 S D F G I，阳光照亮了整个房间，红墙和绿墙还把颜色染到了地面上。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "d309475a9886854721805fc3dd36aaa14ee7929138f9666f49261c4a0589bad2",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s2-0-d309475a9886",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s2-0-d309475a9886/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.35,
    "raw_sha256": "1ac5c8f42ba36126b4b5a68e9d3a543734b592907e7d4a160ebc0524196c723d",
    "raw_seconds": 7.52
  },
  "c4s2-1": {
    "line": "c4s2-1",
    "text": "切到 G I Buffer 视图，就能单独查看间接光的贡献。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "24dec032a94e8200922e96a930c34c2eb863e69b66e29aa13b68887cdffb401f",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s2-1-24dec032a94e",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s2-1-24dec032a94e/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 20.51,
    "raw_sha256": "69e9fc3e8a8edd6ede13b74e74b99919ea419aada2bc4de313e051130bcaf27a",
    "raw_seconds": 4.76
  },
  "c4s3-0": {
    "line": "c4s3-0",
    "text": "屏幕空间效果比较便宜：S S A O 让墙角和接触处变暗，",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "12251b59540f3e37d112e2074b34e8fd7a543acec4dfe4a6d7dc3aa3d37fb8f6",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s3-0-12251b59540f",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s3-0-12251b59540f/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.16,
    "raw_sha256": "049eea55738cf67329f9d8bb4b65593e743a001bea27627023719f00aff5f9fc",
    "raw_seconds": 6.68
  },
  "c4s3-1": {
    "line": "c4s3-1",
    "text": "S S R 让光滑地板映出房间，但只能反射屏幕上看得见的东西。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "aae786012b1127f307032282dca936d58d361043e1c9b8d1dff001f483a9bde4",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s3-1-aae786012b11",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s3-1-aae786012b11/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.2,
    "raw_sha256": "ebb6e05bc2f3581209c3c2c3c7003ad25ad3fe375573bc7a3e5ca6db8de5ff36",
    "raw_seconds": 6.64
  },
  "c4s4-0": {
    "line": "c4s4-0",
    "text": "光照在 HDR 中计算，亮度可以远大于一，屏幕却只能显示零到一。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "765236b5db189cf24d3e1f0578973bc250f6eb30b525332adb714850f37c8bb2",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s4-0-765236b5db18",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s4-0-765236b5db18/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.25,
    "raw_sha256": "c0fd10d93161374b4cbbabe244f43456b9a5d97b5e6c077befb4e045c4361807",
    "raw_seconds": 6.88
  },
  "c4s4-1": {
    "line": "c4s4-1",
    "text": "Linear 直接截断，窗口和发光球变成了一片死白；",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "b4f9cb36b95b740144f5b14222e6bb3585d8346c1f0221a6ca23dc2aaef878ba",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s4-1-b4f9cb36b95b",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s4-1-b4f9cb36b95b/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.12,
    "raw_sha256": "abbccf797b2ef58f6d6c92eaa0f8b4ea4bef6ddd1d91607d2d1c62630a1191a3",
    "raw_seconds": 4.88
  },
  "c4s4-2": {
    "line": "c4s4-2",
    "text": "换成 A G X 色调映射，高光被平滑压缩，自然地过渡到白色。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "f4bf5af69501703f14b93145bfd66eb330c6533c9cae52161a9dbf638892a04e",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s4-2-f4bf5af69501",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s4-2-f4bf5af69501/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.18,
    "raw_sha256": "731d8ba41a8c0c1b7853d84cbb48e7e55bbb6fab06284d5143708a349de93648",
    "raw_seconds": 6.68
  },
  "c4s5-0": {
    "line": "c4s5-0",
    "text": "辉光主要作用于超过阈值的高亮像素，把它们模糊后叠加回去。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "0c239099752cb406eade6f200314a9dabf0227eb0e18862786349c5d7f045c0d",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s5-0-0c239099752c",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s5-0-0c239099752c/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.34,
    "raw_sha256": "f1e577907f443e9dcbf85c2055bb81777bb9642c7e73fcd575a7e759df2bdfd4",
    "raw_seconds": 5.72
  },
  "c4s6-0": {
    "line": "c4s6-0",
    "text": "体积雾在空间里计算光的散射，阳光穿过窗户，形成了光柱。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "eba2cf3a361ba5a43d12fcbb5cbcb38adb493bc35f76f8a91198118264ab2f4f",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s6-0-eba2cf3a361b",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s6-0-eba2cf3a361b/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.17,
    "raw_sha256": "5814e39431e3f7e296c38fd47b2bfe6005a770be61586bd27631ee4c8c778826",
    "raw_seconds": 5.96
  },
  "c4s7-0": {
    "line": "c4s7-0",
    "text": "调色发生在色调映射之后：这张三维查找表让暗部偏青、亮部偏橙。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "32648de98a240b8a09b174c36b5fff2e0216b3e8006997f52060dd2f000e4806",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s7-0-32648de98a24",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s7-0-32648de98a24/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.24,
    "raw_sha256": "9d70192315ee6e1138b4f825b939d7ffec42bbc76ad4c1cece3db16588f6f554",
    "raw_seconds": 7.6
  },
  "c4s8-0": {
    "line": "c4s8-0",
    "text": "效果全开以后，记得看 GPU 耗时，再逐个关闭，找出最贵的那一项。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "19b146404a944184db442cce01e845affcdd5e70acb4021b145aef3795bd5d46",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s8-0-19b146404a94",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c4s8-0-19b146404a94/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.36,
    "raw_sha256": "c8a3fd62395a7436e22bd4839a002a87f73acf6b2d8d06707a09ad144a977bee",
    "raw_seconds": 6.64
  },
  "c5s1-0": {
    "line": "c5s1-0",
    "text": "氛围不是某一个参数，而是好几层光的组合。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "f1366ce381f6b2ab1beb08eea50c0c5166aa8cb75869e3e1e6362039dcd71e81",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s1-0-f1366ce381f6",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s1-0-f1366ce381f6/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.1,
    "raw_sha256": "dcec23606602aa0e3c428fb6d641c5a3beca51a7a143db827d2acb3db86e97ed",
    "raw_seconds": 4.04
  },
  "c5s1-1": {
    "line": "c5s1-1",
    "text": "以黄金时刻为例：低角度的暖色主光，加上冷蓝色的天空补光。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "7c4a89e9dc0fc48eac86916389c7dd5970cef2b8d5d937e9c84ed87630afc9b5",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s1-1-7c4a89e9dc0f",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s1-1-7c4a89e9dc0f/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.12,
    "raw_sha256": "1def0a6bc0014ac418c4336f7b40774b71c38ddef6ad05f659ce57234026db91",
    "raw_seconds": 6.32
  },
  "c5s1-2": {
    "line": "c5s1-2",
    "text": "主光决定方向和时间，补光决定暗部的颜色。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "e70c94555865efce0b6aa62821ff867999daa5874c482a181be97ba1bc62dd1b",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s1-2-e70c94555865",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s1-2-e70c94555865/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.09,
    "raw_sha256": "0de49a2bf98faa2febca4a2e4a950d5287b97a8104d4c40b5f3376031ded7273",
    "raw_seconds": 4.44
  },
  "c5s2-0": {
    "line": "c5s2-0",
    "text": "现在一层一层关掉。先关主光，画面立刻失去了方向和时间感。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "840ff3b1fb3221c32f54e48cdc7564201a9f6480aefcf1b2cef76b251108361e",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-0-840ff3b1fb32",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-0-840ff3b1fb32/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.23,
    "raw_sha256": "8f1092e66f7011c08d017c5fd2a0aca21e1c8ba60d6c38e5f89e650dab7c4f7a",
    "raw_seconds": 7.24
  },
  "c5s2-1": {
    "line": "c5s2-1",
    "text": "再关天空环境光，暗部直接发黑。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "c61f7897bf83d2d2518bccf0580e9d89ca4b1263062dcd08c9b7a0d66032a95f",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-1-c61f7897bf83",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-1-c61f7897bf83/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.01,
    "raw_sha256": "0b6b6a25e1e3a9e45987abba309b7ac2e6716515bd1148856cbc3186ce35d3d7",
    "raw_seconds": 3.56
  },
  "c5s2-2": {
    "line": "c5s2-2",
    "text": "关掉雾和体积雾，纵深感消失；关掉后处理，画面变得平淡。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "b4e1b6b1c71d0e8a93cd5529747b8a851b3986a5d5c5d1a676424b6ff6b999f0",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-2-b4e1b6b1c71d",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-2-b4e1b6b1c71d/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 19.23,
    "raw_sha256": "e8bb45e892c764fe57d19332beb9ebb6261049a4b3ad82234bb9036fd30007e2",
    "raw_seconds": 7.0
  },
  "c5s2-3": {
    "line": "c5s2-3",
    "text": "全部打开，每一层的贡献就一目了然。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "000d063854e7b885a396b9422348934834e71084c22e9c693c0d2b33c726d7ea",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-3-000d063854e7",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s2-3-000d063854e7/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 16.92,
    "raw_sha256": "26e59c272ae42e6415593098cc6ed58c6e7aba193cb775ae0c785751b4746515",
    "raw_seconds": 3.84
  },
  "c5s3-0": {
    "line": "c5s3-0",
    "text": "配方之间可以插值，比如从正午平滑过渡到黄金时刻。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "4a4f1604b32f573319b573d4a6abaae30c4e7785c435bf4902dbf86b33360739",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s3-0-4a4f1604b32f",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s3-0-4a4f1604b32f/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.21,
    "raw_sha256": "d8f84b7f91b7531f08e9b7727d0e33baf62ea785a3b729f3e9c130b3bee8000d",
    "raw_seconds": 5.44
  },
  "c5s3-1": {
    "line": "c5s3-1",
    "text": "time of day 则驱动整个昼夜循环：太阳落下，路灯亮起。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "df2e7bbf7c4d25ac713027b59c4e0bae0e25d77f36df567de2003a3f3efe81d6",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s3-1-df2e7bbf7c4d",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s3-1-df2e7bbf7c4d/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.17,
    "raw_sha256": "3bcaf0267e072cb7a45b49ce960eb4345d619112a2ab698712458d16008e189c",
    "raw_seconds": 6.32
  },
  "c5s4-0": {
    "line": "c5s4-0",
    "text": "霓虹雨夜：冷色的环境，加上饱和的霓虹灯和湿地面的反射。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "1b90824191df701ea775dbe2237832d7ec23e4e3826bc0e8a3b9082f33cbfdbd",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s4-0-1b90824191df",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s4-0-1b90824191df/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 17.14,
    "raw_sha256": "ef1ba18e90619229b0f7df9a60c9d94d297b1a126870bc443965902993678e59",
    "raw_seconds": 5.84
  },
  "c5s5-0": {
    "line": "c5s5-0",
    "text": "丁达尔光：阳光穿过藤架的缝隙，体积雾让光束有了形状。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "4e2bdef4f337eebfb627dd8264b725e2dd4c003feade25e7a712150a5307efe9",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s5-0-4e2bdef4f337",
    "raw": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s5-0-4e2bdef4f337/steps/synthesis/attempt-001/raw.wav",
    "quality_status": "technical-passed",
    "warnings": [],
    "elapsed_seconds": 16.91,
    "raw_sha256": "da262b76c1a526725ca6797285ab3951c210ee338e7f38ba099eae5dc0ca4a12",
    "raw_seconds": 5.72
  },
  "c5s6-0": {
    "line": "c5s6-0",
    "text": "恐怖氛围则是做减法：信息越少越好，灯光不稳定，再压暗四周。",
    "seed": 20261102,
    "cache_key": "6c89ce7a7466574b4a951d725926d45af114416fa2748ff9490d54e5cdc9154d",
    "aw_output": "<aw-project>/art/derived/narration/c5s6-0-6c89ce7a7466",
